Subject: [PATCH 4/9] Results: full ledger suite passes; correct the
 expectation about two existing tests

The complete midnight-ledger-v10 package (lib, every integration test) passes
under real proving. micro-dao and token_vault_shielded use the native token
type, which the CSL relation accepts under Empty, so they were never going to
fail; the earlier note said otherwise and is corrected.

